'''Vita Kari''' (born November 11, 1994) is an American visual artist and [[social media personality]]. They work across performance art, video art, and textiles.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Benzine |first=Vittoria |title=Vita Kari Is Locking Themself in a Box For 24 Hours to Apologize |url=https://www.wmagazine.com/culture/vita-kari-apology-box-tiktok-artist-interview |website=W Magazine |date=2025-07-14 |access-date=2026-04-21}}</ref> Kari is [[non-binary]] and explore different media for art creation such as sculptural works, performances, and videos which analyze the boundaries between online visual art and physical artistic presentation.

